{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And they shall keep your charge and the charge of all the Tent.</b> The Levites shall keep your charge, which is the Holy of Holies, and the charge of the rest of the Mishkan — that which is outside the planks of the Mishkan." "<b>But regarding the holy vessels.</b> Which are inside the Mishkan — they are the Menorah, the Table, and the golden altar." "<b>And regarding the altar.</b> The outer one, which is the altar of burnt offering, even though it is outside the planks."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:17.427477495Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}